        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located just outside the attractive village of Inch and approximately 7 km from Killeagh, this impressive detached bungalow offers a wonderful combination of space, privacy and countryside living. Set on approximately 1.3 acres of mature, landscaped grounds, the property provides generous accommodation together with extensive outdoor space, large parking areas and a substantial workshop.\r\n\r\nApproached via a beautiful stone-fronted entrance with electric gates, the property enjoys a high degree of privacy and is surrounded by mature gardens, lawns and established planting. A large rear patio provides an ideal space for outdoor entertaining while taking full advantage of the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the impressive open-plan kitchen/living area, featuring tiled flooring, a stove and a fully fitted modern kitchen with an abundance of storage, integrated appliances and a large central island. This is a bright and welcoming space that is perfectly suited to family life and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe dining room/sunroom continues the sense of space, with tiled flooring and double doors leading through to the family room. There is also a large utility room, providing excellent additional storage and practical workspace.\r\n\r\nThe comfortable sitting room/lounge features a characterful cast-iron stove and sliding doors leading into the rear conservatory. The conservatory has tiled flooring and two sets of double doors opening directly onto the beautifully landscaped gardens, creating a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces.\r\n\r\nAccommodation also includes a large master bedroom to the rear, complete with mirrored sliderobes and views towards the gardens. The property also benefits from a large, fully tiled family bathroom, incorporating a generous shower and corner bath, 2 large guest bedrooms with ensuites and one single bedroom. \r\n\r\nThe home is equipped with oil-fired central heating and double-glazed windows, providing comfort throughout the year.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property offers exceptional space, including 1.3 acres of mature private gardens, extensive parking, a large rear patio and a substantial workshop. The combination of the private setting, generous grounds and versatile outbuildings makes this an ideal home for those seeking space and tranquillity while remaining within easy reach of nearby villages and amenities."
      },
